WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,980
I started to meet the captain so quickly

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,900
The special bureau needs the fusion of thermal weapons and spiritual power

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,660
Okay. Can you guys wait a moment?

4
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,980
Student ID card, access card and class schedule are all here

5
00:00:16,770 --> 00:00:18,210
There is one less person in the girls dormitory

6
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:20,210
Is it okay to start 7707?

7
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:22,090
Okay, thank you principal

8
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,740
Principal Zhang, I have nothing else to do. Let’s leave first.

9
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,740
If you have anything, you can contact me anytime

10
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,940
The captain’s ID photo is also so beautiful

11
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,280
The Chief Student Officer will arrange it personally

12
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,520
What is his origin?

13
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,340
The last name doesn’t match up

14
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,060
Don’t ask what you shouldn’t ask

15
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:40,140
Don't worry. I have lived with my senior sister before.

16
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:50,910
Who are you looking for if the door is unlocked?

17
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:52,430
I'm the only one in this dormitory
